▸ Creating worktree: service → feature/feat (base: origin/main)
HEAD is now at <SHA> init service
▸ Creating worktree: admin → feature/feat (base: origin/main)
HEAD is now at <SHA> init admin
▸ Creating worktree: docs → feature/feat (base: origin/main)
HEAD is now at <SHA> init docs

▸ Workspace feat ready at <SANDBOX>/platform/workspaces/feat
▸ Branch: feature/feat
▸ Dependencies not installed. Run 'becket deps' inside a repo before running its code.
